  "about": "The Studio sound base: what Studio knows when it directs sound for one video. Moods are scored from the contract (style, motion tempo, easing, colours, scene kinds and the brief's own words); the palette (when the style leaves it open) and the key are chosen here, and the moods then steer generate.py and compose.py, which design every effect and the music anew for each video. Nothing here is a recording or a finished sound. Edit this file to teach Studio new words, moods or palette fits; keep weights between 0 and 1.",
